[INPUT]
- reference_image: {참고 이미지}
- language: Korean
- output_size: 1024x1536

[1. PURPOSE]
Create a vertical cinematic comic poster from a reference portrait.
Transform the subject into an arctic sci-fi survivor with multi-panel storytelling.

[2. OBJECT & COMPOSITION]
- Preserve the identity cues of {주인공} from {참고 이미지}, adapting pose and wardrobe into {의상}.
- Main hero placed center, full-body, holding {소품} in front of torso.
- Surround the hero with {레이아웃 방향}: tilted comic panels on top, left, and right.
- Background is {배경}, with {눈보라 강도} crossing all panels as one unified atmosphere.
- Use {강조색} only on the inner clothing and small visual accents to contrast the white scene.

[3. CORE STRUCTURE]
1) Header / top — three slanted panels: left close-up face with {좌상단 캡션}, center side profile with {상단중앙 캡션}, right distant full-body shot with {우상단 캡션}.
2) Hero area — central tall panel-free figure: {주인공} in {의상}, holding {소품}, direct serious gaze, wind-blown hair and straps.
3) Mid section — left helmet close-up panel with {좌중단 캡션1} and {좌중단 캡션2}; right chest detail panel with {우중단 캡션1} and {우중단 캡션2}.
4) Bottom / CTA — left walking panel with {좌하단 캡션1} and {좌하단 캡션2}; right storm and rear-view panels with {우하단 캡션1}, {우하단 캡션2}, {최하단 캡션1}, {최하단 캡션2}, {최하단 캡션3}; oversized brush title {메인 제목} bottom-left; chapter box bottom-right with {챕터 라벨} and {부제목}.

[4. STYLE RULES]
- Typography: Korean comic handwritten sans for captions; heavy jagged brush lettering for {메인 제목}; condensed bold sans for {부제목}.
- Caption boxes use {말풍선 스타일}, slightly tilted and integrated into each panel.
- Panel borders are thick {패널 테두리 색}, irregular ink strokes, dynamic diagonal cuts.
- Palette: snow white, ice blue, blue-gray shadows, black ink, and {강조색} as the only warm accent.
- Surface treatment: {종이 질감}, halftone speckles, ink splatter around large title.

[5. VISUAL STYLE]
- Camera / lens: mixed comic montage; central hero like 35mm full-body editorial shot, close-up panels like 85mm portrait crops, helmet detail like macro insert.
- Lighting: cold diffused overcast snow light, soft frontal fill, silver reflections on helmet visor.
- Color grade: desaturated arctic blue, high contrast black ink outlines, cinematic webtoon poster finish.

[6. MOOD]
Lonely, dramatic survival sci-fi with premium Korean webtoon cover energy.

[7. CRITICAL]
- Korean text accuracy: {좌상단 캡션}
- Korean text accuracy: {상단중앙 캡션}
- Korean text accuracy: {우상단 캡션}
- Korean text accuracy: {좌중단 캡션1}
- Korean text accuracy: {좌중단 캡션2}
- Korean text accuracy: {우중단 캡션1}
- Korean text accuracy: {우중단 캡션2}
- Korean text accuracy: {좌하단 캡션1}
- Korean text accuracy: {좌하단 캡션2}
- Korean text accuracy: {우하단 캡션1}
- Korean text accuracy: {우하단 캡션2}
- Korean text accuracy: {최하단 캡션1}
- Korean text accuracy: {최하단 캡션2}
- Korean text accuracy: {최하단 캡션3}
- Korean text accuracy: {메인 제목}
- Korean text accuracy: {챕터 라벨}
- Korean text accuracy: {부제목}
- Preserve recognizable facial identity from the reference image while changing costume and setting.
- Hands anatomically correct, 5 fingers where visible, natural grip on helmet.
- Comic panels must remain readable, with clean borders and non-overlapping caption boxes.

[8. 🚫 PROHIBITED]
- Real brand logos (Apple, Samsung, Naver, Kakao, etc)
- Fake official seals / certifications
- Broken Korean characters
- Celebrity / unauthorized likeness mixing
